That combination is unusual. But we have not proven it is better yet.
What would make it new
It becomes new or at least research-worthy if we can show one of these:
Hyperbolic graph extrusion improves transfer over a flat graph controller.
Group-action quotienting reduces attention/computation without hurting performance.
Singularity flags predict failures better than ordinary confidence/margin.
